# Bounded common-unit vocabulary for the no-PSRAM speech simulator profile.
# This is intentionally not the full GNU Units catalogue. Cardulator's direct
# conversion handlers still run first. Unknown names must report an error.
kg !
kilogram kg
s !
second s
m !
meter m
A !
ampere A
K !
kelvin K
mol !
mole mol
cd !
candela cd
pi 3.14159265358979323846
radian 1
rad radian
degree pi/180 radian
deg degree
turn 2 pi radian
gram 0.001 kg
g gram
milligram 0.001 gram
tonne 1000 kg
pound 0.45359237 kg
lb pound
ounce 1|16 pound
oz ounce
millimeter 0.001 m
mm millimeter
centimeter 0.01 m
cm centimeter
kilometer 1000 m
km kilometer
inch 0.0254 m
in inch
foot 12 inch
ft foot
yard 3 foot
yd yard
mile 5280 foot
mi mile
furlong 660 foot
nauticalmile 1852 m
minute 60 s
min minute
hour 60 minute
hr hour
day 24 hour
week 7 day
millisecond 0.001 s
ms millisecond
microsecond 0.000001 s
liter 0.001 m^3
litre liter
L liter
milliliter 0.001 liter
ml milliliter
gallon 231 inch^3
quart 1|4 gallon
pint 1|8 gallon
cup 1|16 gallon
newton kg m/s^2
N newton
pascal newton/m^2
Pa pascal
bar 100000 pascal
atm 101325 pascal
psi pound 9.80665 m/s^2/inch^2
joule newton m
J joule
watt joule/s
W watt
kilowatt 1000 watt
kW kilowatt
watthour watt hour
kWh 1000 watthour
calorie 4.184 joule
kilocalorie 1000 calorie
hertz 1/s
Hz hertz
coulomb A s
C coulomb
volt watt/A
V volt
ohm volt/A
farad coulomb/volt
henry volt s/A
tesla volt s/m^2
mph mile/hour
kph kilometer/hour
knot nauticalmile/hour
